		{"vo", ch="sen07", path=":vo/007/", file="sen070500160"},
		{"text"},
		line=671,
	},
	{
		{"fg", id=1, path=":fg/007/", file="bz07201", face="tat_z0701202", x=-300},
		{"mwf", path=":fa/007/", file="fac_0701202"},
		{"vo", ch="sen07", path=":vo/007/", file="sen070500170"},
		{"text"},
		line=676,
	},
	{
		{"fg", id=1, path=":fg/007/", file="bz07101", face="tat_z0701201", x=-300},
		{"mwf", path=":fa/007/", file="fac_0701201"},
		{"vo", ch="sen07", path=":vo/007/", file="sen070500180"},
		{"text"},
		line=681,
	},
	{
		{"fg", id=2, path=":fg/003/", file="bz03103", face="tat_z0301501", x=300},
		{"mwf", path=":fa/003/", file="fac_0303501"},
		{"vo", ch="sen03", path=":vo/003/", file="sen030509820"},
		{"text"},
		line=686,
	},
	{
		{"fg", id=1, path=":fg/007/", file="bz07101", face="tat_z0701211", x=-300},
		{"mwf", path=":fa/007/", file="fac_0701211"},
		{"vo", ch="sen07", path=":vo/007/", file="sen070500190"},
		{"text"},
		line=691,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050200"},
		line=691,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We dress ourselves in silence before turning to face each other.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, is your body feeling all right?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not particularly... I can still hardly tell up from down...”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. I shouldn't have gone so hard at the end.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"It was Kotone's first time, and yet I let myself get carried away, ravishing her to my heart's content.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, no, I would not mind in the slightest if you were to go even─”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aah, n-never mind.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"If she doesn't want me to mind it, then mind it I won't.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehee, we really did it...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We sure did.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"And just as she said, I was able to figure out my true feelings.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I love Kotone. From the bottom of my heart, I love her.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"This I'm now certain of.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How do you intend to tell Akari-sama about us?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll just tell her like it is.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huuuh?! Y-You mean, everything we just did?!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Use some common sense. She doesn't need to know the specific details.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Even with how understanding my lord is, there's still no telling how she'd react if I told her all the sordid details of what I did with Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Discretion is the better part of fealty, after all.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whew, thank goodness...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If all the things I said in the middle of our lovemaking were to be laid bare to Akari-sama, I would immediately find the nearest tree to hang myself from.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not happening, so don't hang yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What do you intend to tell Akari-sama, then?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"It seems Kotone is still rather worried about how exactly\nI'm going to explain things to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The two of them are very close, so she's probably concerned about what Akari will think of her.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll tell her we're to become man and wife.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...M-Man and wife?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've already consummated our relationship, so I'm going to take my responsibility as a man.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you truly intend to...?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I claimed a priestess's precious chastity, so it's only natural.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My chastity is hardly worth anything. What really matters are your feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you truly intend to join yourself in matrimony with me?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I love you, Kotone. I could want nothing more.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes begin to shimmer.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, oh my... Could there be any greater joy than this?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To think that I would truly become Mitsurugi-sama's bride...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Deeply moved, she squeezes my hand hard.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, I am Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't intend to become wedded to you simply because I am Mitsurugi and you are the Exalt Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I fell in love not with the Exalt-Priestess, but with you, Shiinoha Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes... And the man that I love is you, Tokita Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I nod at Kotone's declaration.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am a warrior. One who is prepared to die so long as my lord commands it.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And I believe that as Exalt-Priestess, you are also resolved to give up your life if ever the occasion demands it.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But if it's at all possible, I want you to enjoy a long and happy life.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“For as long as this life of mine goes on, that will be my one desire.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so from now on, I'm going to cherish my life as much as I can.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And I want you to do the same for your own life.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's live on together, for as long as we can.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, that sounds wonderful!”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Tears running down her cheeks, Kotone shows me a smile brimming with joy.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Seven days later─",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"After waiting for our wounds to heal, we steal into Tenkyo under cover of darkness.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's been a long while since we've been here.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"We expected security to be tight, but we barely encountered any Republican soldiers patrolling the streets.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Thanks to that, we managed to arrive at Miyoshi without being noticed.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Though it goes without saying that we still took the utmost care to avoid detection.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I must say, it feels rather anticlimactic that we were able to slip in so easily.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"We can't afford to let our guard down, but it definitely helps that we have so much freedom to move around.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, don't you want to at least show your face at the Imperial Temple?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I would certainly like to see everyone and ensure that they are safe, but it would surely cause them trouble if I were to reveal myself.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is terribly lonely, but I shall endure it.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"All of us, Kotone included, are still wanted criminals.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"If we were to act carelessly, it could easily turn out badly for us.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Lonely, are we?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Akari fixes me with a pointed look.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though the guy you just started seeing is right here with you?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh gosh, you agreed to stop bringing that up!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama is to be my ≪husband,≫ so it is only natural that he should remain by my side!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kotone blushes and gives me a slap on the shoulder for some reason.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“≪Hazubando?≫”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Pretty sure that means 'a married man.'”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Well in that case, I suppose she has a point.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah... I can't stand to watch this anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"When I told Akari that Kotone and I intended to start a family together, she readily accepted it.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"All she said was, “Oh, sounds good. You'd better take good care of her.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I was bracing myself for her to have a lot more to say, so I was taken rather off-guard.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, I'm not gonna tell you to stop flirting with her, but\ndon't you screw up when it counts, got it?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am your blade. That hasn't changed.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And my man.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Akari answers Kotone's unnecessary interjection with a cold glare.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"But Kotone is wholly unfazed.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"It feels like Kotone has gotten even more brazen ever since we promised ourselves to each other.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, you certainly seem to be enjoying yourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san arrives to serve us a simple dinner.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san! Thank you for having us.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"After Operation Bellflower failed, Hotori was captured, and we were forced to flee Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san was the one who picked up the pieces and rallied the surviving warriors.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"All that on top of looking after Maki, who still isn't able to walk on his own.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please, think nothing of it.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“No Republican soldiers will find you here, so you may be at ease.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Has there been any contact from Koyuzu?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Koyuzu infiltrated Tenkyo several days ahead of us.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"We wanted her to track down where Hotori is being held.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, she paid me a visit the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“She overheard someone talk of having seen Hotori-sama, so we can be certain that she is to be found in a Republican Army garrison.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“However, as Hotori-sama's exact location is still unknown, Koyuzu has already resumed her investigation.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I'll make sure to commend her efforts next time I see her.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sounds like it's gonna take a while, though.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I suppose we will have nothing to do for the time being.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san, I had a question I wanted to ask.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"The meal Mutsumi-san prepared for us is ochazuke topped with grilled salmon.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I pause to swallow a mouthful of the rich, brothy rice before asking my question.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We kept a close eye out for the Republican Army on our way here, but I felt like there weren't many soldiers on patrol at all.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have there been any developments we're not aware of?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed there have. It just hasn't been officially announced yet.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Apparently Governor-General Warren will be departing the Empire shortly.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why might he be doing that?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“From what I have heard, he will be diverting his troops to other theaters of war.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It would appear that the Republic has stretched themselves too thinly across too many fronts, to the point of near-collapse.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hence, he is intending to redeploy his primary forces to reinforce those fronts.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“The Army has already commenced its withdrawal, so that is likely the reason there are so few soldiers to be found.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What will happen to the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I suspect that it will continue to be governed by Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Though, with only a few thousand troops remaining under her command, I daresay it will be rather trying for her moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Dumping all the clean-up on his daughter, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Though I guess that just goes to show how little they think of us now.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Suddenly, the entrance to Miyoshi is thrown wide open.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Mutsumi-san! I come bearing important news!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, Tokita-san and Miyaguni-sama, you came at just the right time!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Koyuzu? What is the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I have located Hotori-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But that hardly matters at this point!”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama has rallied the captured warriors and priestesses to start an armed uprising! Even as we speak, they are fighting in the Republican occupation zone!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What?!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Everyone in the restaurant leaps to their feet at the shocking news.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“They have the upper hand at present, but the situation will surely turn against them as time passes!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I beg you, please fly to their aid at once!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the plan, Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't it obvious? We're gonna go help them.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just what I was waiting to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I turn towards the door, blade in hand.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please allow me to accompany you!”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I will make for the Imperial Temple and recruit any and all priestesses who might aid our cause.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, we'll never be able to protect all the priestesses with our limited numbers.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"They were forced to fight on the front lines in the Battle for Inner Iseya, but priestesses are meant to remain safe from harm in the rear.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh... How could my man be so cruel as to abandon his wife like this?!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what you say, I can't do the impossible. Just give it up this time.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well said. Good to see you haven't totally lost your spine.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Akari murmurs with a wry smile as she makes her preparations for the impending battle.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“In that case, I suppose I shall have to protect Kotone-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I will rally the Sarashina warriors and gather them here at once.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“We may then pay the Imperial Temple a visit, gather more allies, and proceed to Hotori-sama's aid all together.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you truly mean it?!”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But of course. Come, Your Eminence, let us turn the tide of battle.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
